  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 119a645d648fe4a4c86c14f18251ec06, type: 3}
  m_Name: intro_crawl
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  presentation: 1
  lines:
  - speaker: 
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: The storm came without warning.
  - speaker: 
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: One moment, a little yellow tang was grazing beside its family on the reef.
      The next, the sea turned to thunder and the current tore it away.
  - speaker: 
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: When the water finally calmed, home was gone. Only strange coral, strange
      fish and an enormous, hungry ocean remained.
  - speaker: 
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: But the old currents whisper of a Golden Light, deep in the sea, that shines
      on every lost fish's home.
  - speaker: 
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: To reach it, the tang must grow strong, swim far, and choose what kind
      of fish it wants to be.
  choices: []
  flagToSetWhenFinished: introSeen
  abilityWhenFinished: 0
  journalTitle: 
